# Dashboard Module

> Operational command center for Oil & Gas OS.

---

# Overview

The Dashboard provides a real-time overview of acquisition activity across the organization.

It consolidates operational metrics, campaign schedules, flagged due diligence items, and deal pipeline health into a single workspace.

The Dashboard serves as the default landing page after user authentication.

---

# Objectives

The Dashboard enables users to:

- Monitor active acquisitions
- Review campaign schedules
- Identify blocked deals
- Track pipeline value
- Measure operational performance
- Surface high-priority tasks

---

# Key Metrics

## Open Deals

Displays:

- Number of active acquisitions
- Estimated pipeline value

Example:

238 Open Deals

$6,863,946 Pipeline Value

---

## Closed Deals

Displays:

- Closed transactions
- Total acquisition value

Example:

535 Closed Deals

$17,991,474 Acquired

---

## Flagged Due Diligence

Shows deals requiring attention.

Examples:

- Missing title documents
- Probate issues
- Ownership discrepancies
- Curative requirements

---

## Mailer Records

Displays

- Total mail records
- Campaign count
- Active touches

---

